<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.repository.scylla_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/contracts/service_contracts.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.repository.scylla_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#status> "dependency" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.scylla.topology_and_readiness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#Contract> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.scylla.topology_and_readiness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ScyllaDB is a topology-sensitive dependency. Seed list, listen_address, and rpc_address must match the approved cluster topology. Cluster_name must match. All downstream services (workflow, event, resource, repository) depend on Scylla." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.scylla.topology_and_readiness> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/contracts/service_contracts.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.scylla.topology_and_readiness> <https://globular.io/awareness#status> "topology" .
