<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.systemd.runtime_proof> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Systemd is runtime proof, not authority. \"systemd active\" is not enough — runtime readiness must include health and dependency checks. A service can be active with a broken port or failed healthcheck." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.systemd.runtime_proof> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/contracts/authority_contracts.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.systemd.runtime_proof> <https://globular.io/awareness#status> "runtime_proof" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.workflow.foreach_guard_order> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#Contract> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.workflow.foreach_guard_order> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A foreach step's `when` guard must be evaluated BEFORE the foreach collection is resolved, matching the non-foreach dispatch path (executeStep), which evaluates `when` before the step body runs. A step explicitly gated off by `when: false` must never fail merely because its collection reference happens to resolve to nil (e.g. an empty result serialized to JSON null across an actor RPC boundary)." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.workflow.foreach_guard_order> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/contracts/service_contracts.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.workflow.foreach_guard_order> <https://globular.io/awareness#status> "execution_order" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.workflow.foreach_guard_order> <https://globular.io/awareness#violatedBy> <https://globular.io/awareness#failureMode/workflow.foreach_when_guard_evaluated_after_collection_resolution> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.workflow.scylla_dependency> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#Contract> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.workflow.scylla_dependency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The workflow service depends on ScyllaDB for durable receipt storage and event emission. If Scylla is not ready, workflow-backed remediation that requires Scylla durability is unsafe." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.workflow.scylla_dependency> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/contracts/service_contracts.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#contract/contract.workflow.scylla_dependency> <https://globular.io/awareness#status> "dependency" .
