<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/add_causal_rule_without_incident_evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Only add causal rules after an incident has been resolved and the chain has been\ndirectly observed. Reference the incident ID in the rule's comment or metadata.\nSet confidence to \"low\" until the chain recurs and is validated a second time." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/add_causal_rule_without_incident_evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Add an entry to causal_rules.yaml based on theoretical reasoning without\na corresponding incident (INC-YYYY-NNNN) that demonstrated the failure chain.\nHypothetical rules clutter the causal graph with unverifiable noise." .
