<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/aggregate_scoped_value_into_global_without_aggregation_function> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Aggregate only via a named function (e.g. aggregateNodeFindingsToCluster) whose signature carries the scope tag and whose body documents the aggregation rule (any-failed, all-OK, quorum, etc.)." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/aggregate_scoped_value_into_global_without_aggregation_function> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Scope is part of the truth. Stripping it during aggregation produces a value whose shape looks global but whose evidence was local." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/aggregate_scoped_value_into_global_without_aggregation_function> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Treat a per-instance OK as global OK without naming the aggregation" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/aggregate_scoped_value_into_global_without_aggregation_function> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.assertions_must_carry_their_scope> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/aggregate_scoped_value_into_global_without_aggregation_function> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/alias_bundle_sha_into_entrypoint_sha_variable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/alias_bundle_sha_into_entrypoint_sha_variable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Same shape, distinct meaning. Code reads the field name as the truth; the field name must include the subject (bundle_sha vs entrypoint_sha)." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/alias_bundle_sha_into_entrypoint_sha_variable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Use field names disambiguated by subject; never pass one through a variable named for the other." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/alias_bundle_sha_into_entrypoint_sha_variable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Use the same variable for tarball SHA and binary entrypoint SHA" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/alias_bundle_sha_into_entrypoint_sha_variable> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.identity_computation_must_be_invariant> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/alias_bundle_sha_into_entrypoint_sha_variable> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.structure_must_not_be_stripped_in_projection> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/alias_bundle_sha_into_entrypoint_sha_variable> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
