<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/circuit_breaker_that_blocks_all_reconciliation_on_single_service_failure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Isolate per-service install failures; mark the failing service as in-error and continue reconciling others. A global circuit breaker must only fire on control-plane instability (etcd unavailable, no leader), not on individual service errors." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/circuit_breaker_that_blocks_all_reconciliation_on_single_service_failure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Implement a reconciliation circuit breaker that halts the entire reconcile loop when any single service install fails, rather than isolating that service and continuing with others." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/circuit_breaker_that_blocks_all_reconciliation_on_single_service_failure> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/convergence.no_infinite_retry> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/circuit_breaker_that_blocks_all_reconciliation_on_single_service_failure> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.failure_response_must_contract_not_amplify> .
