<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/claim_convergence_from_bootstrap_records> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Check the authoritative field before marking a desired record eligible for install; skip records with source=bootstrap until promotion has run." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/claim_convergence_from_bootstrap_records> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mark the cluster as converged or allow node-agent to install from bootstrap records before the controller promotion reconciler has validated and rewritten them as authoritative." .
