<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/cross_layer_write_by_non_owner> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fcmd%2Finstalled_state_checksum_backfill%2Fmain.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/cross_layer_write_by_non_owner> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fglobularcli%2Fstate_cmds.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/cross_layer_write_by_non_owner> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fmcp%2Ftools_etcd.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/cross_layer_write_by_non_owner> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fnode_agent%2Fnode_agent_server%2Fheartbeat.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/cross_layer_write_by_non_owner> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Frepository%2Frepository_server%2Fartifact_handlers.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/day0_grace_without_expiry_check> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/day0_grace_without_expiry_check> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Encode the grace window as a TTL on installed-state record. Each verdict consumer compares current time to the install timestamp." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/day0_grace_without_expiry_check> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Grace windows are bindings to a phase. The phase ends; the binding must invalidate or the exception becomes permanent." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/day0_grace_without_expiry_check> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Apply Day-0 grace forever because no check verifies \"still within window\"" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/day0_grace_without_expiry_check> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.binding_outlives_evidence_until_invalidated> .
