<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/default_new_edge_to_decision_domain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Start new edge kinds as \"information\" domain. Promote to \"decision\" domain only\nafter the edge has been validated in at least one real incident or preflight\nscenario where the decision guidance was verified correct." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/default_new_edge_to_decision_domain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Add a new edge kind with an optimistic \"decision\" domain classification before\nthe edge has been used in real decision paths and verified to carry actionable\nguidance. Overly broad decision classification inflates path scores and erodes\ntrust in decision_context output." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/default_new_edge_to_decision_domain> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/awareness.graph.domain_classification_required> .
