<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/delete_critical_key_without_policy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Check the registry-defined delete policy before deletion; keys with DeleteNeverAutomatic require a validated delete-approval marker at the correct generation." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/delete_critical_key_without_policy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Delete a critical etcd key without checking the registry-defined delete policy. Keys with DeleteNeverAutomatic must require explicit operator approval." .
