<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/delete_local_override_without_operator_confirmation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/delete_old_published_artifact_versions_to_stop_heartbeat_poisoning> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/delete_old_published_artifact_versions_to_stop_heartbeat_poisoning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Deduplicate in syncRepoArtifactsToEtcd — see iterate_all_artifact_versions_for_kind_resolution." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/delete_old_published_artifact_versions_to_stop_heartbeat_poisoning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The repository is the authoritative artifact history. Deleting published versions to paper over a heartbeat bug destroys the audit trail and breaks rollback candidates. The correct fix is deduplication in the heartbeat." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/delete_old_published_artifact_versions_to_stop_heartbeat_poisoning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Delete or retract old artifact versions from the repository as a workaround for the heartbeat processing them with stale kinds." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/delete_old_published_artifact_versions_to_stop_heartbeat_poisoning> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
