<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/delete_runtime_data_from_ambiguous_state> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Deletion requires a delete-approval marker that matches the current generation, was created by the current leader, and is not older than 24h." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/delete_runtime_data_from_ambiguous_state> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Delete or reset runtime data when the system is in an ambiguous state (recovering, no quorum, missing desired-state key) without explicit operator approval." .
