<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/derive_build_id_from_bundle_filename> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Treat manifest.build_id (UUID) and release-index.build_id as the only authoritative identities. Never pass filename-derived tokens as --build-id. If manifest build_id is unavailable, fail closed or install without overriding expected build_id." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/derive_build_id_from_bundle_filename> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Derive awareness bundle build_id from the tarball filename token (short/hash-like suffix) and pass it to install verification as if it were the authoritative UUID build_id." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/derive_build_id_from_bundle_filename> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/awareness.auto_install_requires_verification> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/derive_build_id_from_bundle_filename> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/desired.build_id_immutable> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/derive_build_id_from_bundle_filename> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.identity_computation_must_be_invariant> .
