<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_evidence_trust_gate_before_remediation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_evidence_trust_gate_before_remediation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Always call CheckEvidenceTrust before APPROVE or EXECUTE. If evidence is stale (> MaxEvidenceAge), return AWAITING_EVIDENCE and re-scan before retrying." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_evidence_trust_gate_before_remediation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Evidence freshness is the only barrier between the doctor's last scan and current cluster state. Stale evidence authorizing remediation causes disruption against already- recovered targets — a silent correctness failure with high blast radius." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_evidence_trust_gate_before_remediation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Remove or skip the CheckEvidenceTrust call before dispatching a remediation action, treating any finding as sufficient authorization regardless of evidence age." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_evidence_trust_gate_before_remediation> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.binding_outlives_evidence_until_invalidated> .
