<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_evidence_trust_gate_before_remediation> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fcluster_doctor%2Fcluster_doctor_server%2Fevidence_provenance.go> .
