<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_node_agent_verify_gate_to_make_installs_pass> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_require_checksum_to_allow_unverifiable_fallback> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_require_checksum_to_allow_unverifiable_fallback> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Keep checksum enforcement on; repair manifest/checksum availability or block install with degraded finding." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_require_checksum_to_allow_unverifiable_fallback> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Turning off checksum requirements so fallback installs proceed without verifiable artifact identity." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_require_checksum_to_allow_unverifiable_fallback> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.fallback_must_degrade_semantics> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_require_checksum_to_allow_unverifiable_fallback> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/repository.fallback_requires_manifest_and_checksum> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/disable_require_checksum_to_allow_unverifiable_fallback> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
