<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_exit_zero_treated_as_invariant_repair> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_package_before_critical_key_prereqs_present> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_package_before_critical_key_prereqs_present> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Check critical key prereqs before dispatch. Block with OutcomeBlockedCriticalKeyMissing and emit a finding. Only dispatch after all prereqs are satisfied." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_package_before_critical_key_prereqs_present> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Missing critical keys cause installation to fail or stall on first use. Blind dispatch wastes reconcile cycles and delays actual convergence. The prereq system emits OutcomeBlockedCriticalKeyMissing as a structured finding so the operator can unblock deliberately." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_package_before_critical_key_prereqs_present> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dispatch a SERVICE or WORKLOAD package install before its required critical etcd keys exist (e.g. /globular/system/config for SERVICE packages)." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_package_before_critical_key_prereqs_present> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
