<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_when_scylla_down> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_when_scylla_down> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Run a Scylla health preflight check before dispatching any workflow; fail fast with a typed error that avoids creating an orphaned record." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_when_scylla_down> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dispatch a workflow when the Scylla backend is known to be unavailable or degraded, producing orphaned workflow records." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_when_scylla_down> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.state_mutations_must_be_durably_committed_before_side_effects> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_when_scylla_down> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/workflow.backend_health_gate> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_when_scylla_down> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_without_checking_wave_blocked_result> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_without_checking_wave_blocked_result> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Check both err AND status. On RUN_STATUS_FAILED, inspect the reason. If WAVE_BLOCKED, enqueue a retry with appropriate backoff." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_without_checking_wave_blocked_result> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "workflow.Run returns RUN_STATUS_FAILED with err=nil for WAVE_BLOCKED — the run did not succeed, it was blocked by a dependency. Discarding this result means the caller never schedules a retry. The block persists forever. This was INC-2026-0017." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_without_checking_wave_blocked_result> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Discard the result of workflow.Run when status=RUN_STATUS_FAILED and err=nil, treating a WAVE_BLOCKED outcome as a successful no-op." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_without_checking_wave_blocked_result> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/workflow.dispatch_is_not_completion> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_without_checking_wave_blocked_result> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/dispatch_workflow_without_checking_wave_blocked_result> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fworkflow%2Fengine%2Fengine.go> .
