<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/doctor_reads_only_inventory> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/doctor_reads_only_inventory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Consume independent runtime proof (GetServiceRuntimeProof per node\nor verifier etcd snapshot) and reconcile claims-vs-proofs. Emit the\ncorresponding finding on each kind of drift." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/doctor_reads_only_inventory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Build doctor rules that read InstalledPackage from etcd and emit\nfindings from inventory-vs-desired comparisons alone. If the apply\npath lied (Phase 1 root-cause), doctor agrees because both layers\nare claims." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/doctor_reads_only_inventory> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/doctor.must_compare_claims_to_proofs> .
