<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/edit_awareness_yaml_without_graph_rebuild> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/edit_awareness_yaml_without_graph_rebuild> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "After editing any awareness YAML, rebuild and reload the awareness graph before calling\nawareness.decision_context or any other graph-querying tool. Treat the graph as\nSTALE until the reload completes." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/edit_awareness_yaml_without_graph_rebuild> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Edit any awareness YAML knowledge file (invariants.yaml, forbidden_fixes.yaml,\ncausal_rules.yaml, failure_modes.yaml, agent_playbooks.yaml, path_weights.yaml)\nand then immediately rely on the graph's decision_context output without rebuilding.\nThe graph is now stale and will return paths that do not reflect the edit." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/edit_awareness_yaml_without_graph_rebuild> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/awareness.knowledge.graph_rebuild_after_yaml_edit> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/edit_awareness_yaml_without_graph_rebuild> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.half_done_must_not_look_done> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/edit_awareness_yaml_without_graph_rebuild> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/edit_impact_path_traversal_without_scoring_test> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/edit_impact_path_traversal_without_scoring_test> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Before modifying traversal: run TestPathScoring_* and TestDecisionContext_* tests.\nAfter modifying: verify that verified decision paths still score above declared\ninformation paths, and that invalid paths score below all valid paths." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/edit_impact_path_traversal_without_scoring_test> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Modify the impact path traversal algorithm (TraverseImpactPaths, traverseTyped,\nedgeTrust, or impactEdgeKinds) without updating or adding tests that verify the\nscoring behavior of the result. Traversal changes silently alter which paths the\ndecision_context returns." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/edit_impact_path_traversal_without_scoring_test> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/awareness.preflight.required_before_edit> .
