<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/error_absorbed_into_empty_map> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/error_absorbed_into_empty_map> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Return `(map[T]V, ok bool)` or a typed `VerdictSet{Verdicts, Source, ObservedAt, Trusted bool}` so consumers can branch on certainty. See `repository/artifact_state.go readPublishStateString` for the exemplar `(value, ok)` shape." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/error_absorbed_into_empty_map> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Authority returns `map[T]V{}` when the source errors, instead of distinguishing \"I haven't checked\" from \"no entries\". Downstream code iterates the empty map and concludes \"nothing applies\"." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/error_absorbed_into_empty_map> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.authority_must_express_uncertainty> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/error_absorbed_into_empty_map> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
