<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/gate_metadata_reads_on_minio_health> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/gate_metadata_reads_on_minio_health> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Serve all artifact metadata (listings, versions, manifests) from ScyllaDB; MinIO health only affects blob download availability." .
