<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_command_package_runtime_expectations_forever> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Migrate commandPackage() classification to read from the catalog package.kind field; add COMMAND entries to the catalog, not to a hardcoded list." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_command_package_runtime_expectations_forever> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Keep the hardcoded commandPackage() list in the doctor rule instead of migrating to catalog-driven package kind checks. The list will drift as new command packages are added." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_command_package_runtime_expectations_forever> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.critical_path_no_non_critical_dependency> .
