<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_command_package_runtime_expectations_forever> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_kind_list_in_reconciler> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_kind_list_in_reconciler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The reconciler must read kind from the package metadata (package.json or catalog).\nNo list of names or prefixes inside reconciler logic. If the metadata is missing,\nfail loudly — do not fall back to a guess." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_kind_list_in_reconciler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Maintain a hardcoded list of service names or prefixes inside the reconciler to\nclassify packages as infrastructure vs service kind, duplicating the canonical\nregistry." .
