<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_node_to_pool_mapping_to_avoid_filter> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_node_to_pool_mapping_to_avoid_filter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Use node.StableIP(clusterVIP) when picking a single representative IP,\nor the nodeAny<X> helpers when matching against ANY of node.Identity.Ips.\nThe node identity primitives ARE the right answer; callers must select\nthe correct one for their use case." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_node_to_pool_mapping_to_avoid_filter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Maintain a hardcoded map of node-id → MinIO pool / etcd peer / DNS record\nin the controller so the VIP-contaminated identity comparison can be\nskipped. Replaces a structural fix with a per-cluster table the operator\nmust keep in sync." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_node_to_pool_mapping_to_avoid_filter> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_package_kind_classification_outside_canonical_registry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_package_kind_classification_outside_canonical_registry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specific instance of inline_catalog_membership_list_in_production_code; elevated because package kind drives convergence path selection." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_package_kind_classification_outside_canonical_registry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Use the canonical kind registry helper (e.g. catalog.KindForPackage). Add a unit test that fails if a new kind isn't recognized everywhere." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_package_kind_classification_outside_canonical_registry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Classify package kind via a hardcoded list rather than the canonical registry" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/hardcode_package_kind_classification_outside_canonical_registry> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.structure_must_not_be_stripped_in_projection> .
