<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/infer_minio_membership_from_disk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Read ObjectStoreDesiredState from etcd at every startup. If the key is absent, hold last-known-good topology and emit a critical alert; never infer membership from local disk presence." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/infer_minio_membership_from_disk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Infer that a node should run MinIO because its data directory exists or because MinIO was previously running, rather than reading the authoritative ObjectStoreDesiredState from etcd." .
