<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/infer_objectstore_topology_from_local_state> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Infer MinIO pool membership from local disk (data directory, .minio.sys, last-run topology) when /globular/objectstore/config is absent." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/infer_objectstore_topology_from_local_state> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.storage_is_not_semantic_authority> .
