<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/infer_topology_from_local_disk> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/infer_topology_from_local_disk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Read topology from etcd (ObjectStoreDesiredState for MinIO, node records for ScyllaDB); if the key is absent, alert and hold; never derive topology from disk state." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/infer_topology_from_local_disk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Decide topology membership or configuration from local disk state (minio data directory, scylla data files) instead of the authoritative desired-state in etcd." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/infer_topology_from_local_disk> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.storage_is_not_semantic_authority> .
