<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_catalog_membership_list_in_production_code> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_catalog_membership_list_in_production_code> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Catalog truth is owned by the registry. Inline copies break the single-source guarantee and produce divergent classification." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_catalog_membership_list_in_production_code> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Read the canonical registry via a typed getter at every consumer site. Test fixtures may use literals; production code must not." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_catalog_membership_list_in_production_code> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Hardcode catalog membership in production code when a canonical registry exists" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_catalog_membership_list_in_production_code> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.structure_must_not_be_stripped_in_projection> .
