<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_multistep_mutation_without_durable_intent_record> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_multistep_mutation_without_durable_intent_record> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Persist the computed plan to etcd/workflow BEFORE running step 1. Each step writes its progress. A new process reads the intent and resumes from the last unfinished step idempotently." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_multistep_mutation_without_durable_intent_record> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The intent record IS the resume contract. Without it, every failure is a corruption rather than a resume point." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_multistep_mutation_without_durable_intent_record> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Execute a multi-step state mutation inline with no persisted intent record" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_multistep_mutation_without_durable_intent_record> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.state_mutations_must_be_durably_committed_before_side_effects> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/inline_multistep_mutation_without_durable_intent_record> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
