<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/mark_release_available_from_local_success> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/mark_release_available_from_local_success> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Collect confirmation from all wave participants; submit the terminal commit only after all have confirmed; the workflow service writes AVAILABLE on commit success." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/mark_release_available_from_local_success> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mark a release wave as AVAILABLE immediately after a single node reports local install success, before all wave participants have confirmed and before the commit RPC succeeds." .
