<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/marking_available_from_local_success_only> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mark a service release AVAILABLE based solely on a local node reporting success, without the controller confirming installed-state in etcd." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/marking_available_from_local_success_only> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/install.result.atomic_commit> .
