<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/marking_release_available_from_local_success> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "AVAILABLE status is written only by the workflow service after all wave steps commit their terminal records to ScyllaDB; local install confirmation is a prerequisite, not the final authority." .
