<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/materialize_desired_from_unverified_local_install> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/materialize_desired_from_unverified_local_install> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Materialize only from release-channel artifacts; apply the regression guard on the materialize path; fail closed on downgrade." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/materialize_desired_from_unverified_local_install> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Materializing desired from whatever is observed installed can pin the cluster to a dev-channel/local-debug artifact and has no regression guard." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/materialize_desired_from_unverified_local_install> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Do not materialize desired-state from an arbitrary observed local install" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/materialize_desired_from_unverified_local_install> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/desired.no_regression_all_paths> .
