<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/move_real_install_workflow_into_release_wrapper> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Keep services/scripts/install.sh a thin release wrapper; the real install workflow authority stays in globular-installer/scripts/install-day0.sh, per docs/design/artifact-authority-matrix.md." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/move_real_install_workflow_into_release_wrapper> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Implement the actual day-0/day-1 install workflow logic inside services/scripts/install.sh (a release wrapper) instead of keeping install execution authority in globular-installer/scripts/install-day0.sh, collapsing two related flows with different owners into one and recreating cross-repo authority drift." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/move_real_install_workflow_into_release_wrapper> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/repo.release_wrapper_is_not_install_execution_authority> .
