<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/package_identity.do_not_archive_desired_pinned_artifact> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes/package_identity_forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/package_identity.do_not_delete_desired_build_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/package_identity.do_not_delete_desired_build_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Desired build_id is the convergence contract. Deleting it hides repository corruption and can roll the cluster to an unintended artifact." .
