<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/publish_unstripped_debug_build_to_release_channel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A non-trimpath / non-stripped build is ~2x size and carries debug symbols and build paths. Publishing it to the release channel ships a debug artifact as a release (the 15-18MB build_number 1 local artifacts) and defeats the artifact-shape gate." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/publish_unstripped_debug_build_to_release_channel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Build release artifacts with -trimpath -ldflags \"-s -w\"; reject oversized or unstripped artifacts at publish on the release channel." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/publish_unstripped_debug_build_to_release_channel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Do not publish an unstripped/non-trimpath (debug) build to the release channel" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/publish_unstripped_debug_build_to_release_channel> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/publish.release_artifact_must_be_stripped> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/publish_unstripped_debug_build_to_release_channel> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/release.version_single_authority> .
