<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/read_owned_etcd_prefix_directly_instead_of_calling_owner_rpc> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fcluster_doctor%2Fcluster_doctor_server%2Frules%2Fpackage_version_authority.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/read_owned_etcd_prefix_directly_instead_of_calling_owner_rpc> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fcluster_doctor%2Fcluster_doctor_server%2Frules%2Frepository_dns_invariants.go> .
