<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/read_owned_etcd_prefix_directly_instead_of_calling_owner_rpc> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fglobularcli%2Frepo_scan_cmds.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/read_owned_etcd_prefix_directly_instead_of_calling_owner_rpc> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fglobularcli%2Fstate_cmds.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/read_per_instance_metric_as_global_without_label_filter> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
