<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/reconcile_topology_without_contract> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Run topology safety preflight (quorum check, participant validation, objectstore consistency) before any drift action; abort the plan if preflight fails." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/reconcile_topology_without_contract> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Apply a topology change in the drift reconciler without first running topology safety preflight checks (quorum viability, participant validity, objectstore consistency)." .
