<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/resolve_build_id_at_install_time> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Resolve build_id in the controller at plan time; embed the resolved ID in DesiredService in etcd; node-agent uses the pre-resolved ID only, never resolves its own." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/resolve_build_id_at_install_time> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Allow node-agent to resolve the build_id at install time rather than using the pre-resolved build_id from DesiredService in etcd." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/resolve_build_id_at_install_time> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/desired.build_id_immutable> .
