<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_dns_only_to_force_record_refresh> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_dns_only_to_force_record_refresh> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fix desired DNS records at authority layer and then reconcile/runtime-verify." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_dns_only_to_force_record_refresh> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Restarting DNS service to force record refresh while desired DNS records remain incorrect in authority state." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_dns_only_to_force_record_refresh> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/dns.records_must_be_installed_and_runtime_healthy> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_dns_only_to_force_record_refresh> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_envoy_in_an_infinite_loop_to_hide_lds_zero_state> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_mcp_without_killing_orphan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_mcp_without_killing_orphan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The globular-mcp.service unit must include ExecStartPre=+/bin/sh -c 'pkill -9 -x mcp_server || true' to terminate orphaned processes before the new instance tries to bind. MUST use -x (process-name match), never -f — `pkill -f` also matches the parent shell's argv and self-SIGKILLs." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_mcp_without_killing_orphan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Restart globular-mcp.service without first killing any orphaned mcp_server process from a prior run that escaped its cgroup and is holding port 10260." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_mcp_without_killing_orphan> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.competing_writers_must_converge_or_be_fenced> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_mcp_without_killing_orphan> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/runtime.installed_state_not_liveness> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_mcp_without_killing_orphan> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
