<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_node_agent_repeatedly_hoping_repository_recovers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Diagnose and repair repository identity/index inconsistencies first; restart agents only after authoritative state is corrected." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/restart_node_agent_repeatedly_hoping_repository_recovers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Repeatedly restarting node-agent as a blind recovery for repository desired-build resolution failures." .
