<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/run_seeder_inline_in_controller_startup_without_workflow_service> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/run_seeder_inline_in_controller_startup_without_workflow_service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Seeder runs as a workflow with idempotent semantics, bounded retry, and\nterminal SUCCEEDED/FAILED. Controller startup schedules the workflow if\nbundle's seed_version differs from ai-memory metadata; the workflow\nservice owns execution." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/run_seeder_inline_in_controller_startup_without_workflow_service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Call the seeder logic directly from the controller's startup path\n(synchronously or via a goroutine) instead of scheduling it as a proper\nWorkflow Service workflow. Bypasses idempotency, bounded retry, and the\nterminal-state contract that the 4-layer model relies on." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/run_seeder_inline_in_controller_startup_without_workflow_service> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/ops_knowledge.seed_integrity> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/run_seeder_inline_in_controller_startup_without_workflow_service> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
