<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/run_unbounded_query_in_reconcile_path> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Wrap all critical-path queries with context.WithTimeout (5-15s); map ctx.Err() timeout to DEGRADED status immediately." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/run_unbounded_query_in_reconcile_path> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Execute a Scylla, etcd, or DNS query in a critical reconcile path without a context deadline or timeout. All critical-path queries must be bounded at 5-15s." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/run_unbounded_query_in_reconcile_path> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/critical_queries.must_be_bounded> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/run_unbounded_query_in_reconcile_path> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.failure_response_must_contract_not_amplify> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/run_unbounded_query_in_reconcile_path> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
