<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_awareness_preflight_before_yaml_edit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_awareness_preflight_before_yaml_edit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Before editing any file in the awareness package or docs/awareness/knowledge/,\ncall awareness.decision_context with goal and changed_files. Review forbidden_actions\nand required_tests. Run all required_tests after the edit." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_awareness_preflight_before_yaml_edit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Edit high-risk awareness files (graph/domain.go, semantic/score.go, integrity/\nimpact_path.go, docs/awareness/knowledge/*.yaml) without first calling\nawareness.preflight or awareness.decision_context to check what the edit touches.\nThis is editing the safety system without reading its own guardrails first." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_awareness_preflight_before_yaml_edit> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/awareness.knowledge.graph_rebuild_after_yaml_edit> .
