<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_blind_spots_when_graph_unavailable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "When graph is unavailable, always include at least: \"graph unavailable — rebuild and reload the awareness graph\",\n\"cannot check files for decision paths\",\nand \"runtime not collected\". These are always true in no-graph mode." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_blind_spots_when_graph_unavailable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Return an empty blind_spots list from decisionContextNoGraph() when the graph\nis unavailable. An empty blind_spots list when the graph is missing implies the\ntool has full coverage — the opposite of the truth." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_blind_spots_when_graph_unavailable> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/awareness.mcp.decision_context_no_bare_no_match> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_blind_spots_when_graph_unavailable> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.absence_scope_must_be_explicit> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_blind_spots_when_graph_unavailable> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_ca_verification_for_internal_addresses> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_circuit_isolation_for_infrastructure_services> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_ddl_preflight_when_group0_table_missing> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_edge_domain_classification> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_edge_domain_classification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For every new edge kind added to graph/edges.go, add the corresponding entry to\nthe edgeDomains map in graph/domain.go before merging. Decision-domain edges\nmust be explicit — they never default." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_edge_domain_classification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Add a new edge kind to graph/edges.go without adding its domain classification\nto graph/domain.go. Unclassified edges default to the information domain, causing\ndecision-relevant edges to be silently downgraded in the semantic scorer." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_edge_domain_classification> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/awareness.graph.domain_classification_required> .
