<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_health_checks_to_avoid_waitactive_timeout> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Diagnose why the service does not reach active state (missing dependency, port conflict, missing config); fix the root cause; keep health checks in place as early-failure guards." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_health_checks_to_avoid_waitactive_timeout> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Remove or disable health checks in the MCP spec or unit file to avoid WaitActive timeout errors, instead of fixing the underlying reason the service does not reach active state." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_health_checks_to_avoid_waitactive_timeout> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/convergence.no_infinite_retry> .
