<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_immutability_check_for_test_environments> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Tests stand up an actual \"seeder\" service-account and authenticate as that\nprincipal. The immutability check is identical in production and test.\nTest-only branches in security-critical code are forbidden surface area." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_immutability_check_for_test_environments> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Disable the seed-immutability check when a test-environment flag is set,\nso integration tests can prepare seed-tagged entries without going through\na real seeder workflow. Creates a code path that exists nowhere in\nproduction but ships in the same binary." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_immutability_check_for_test_environments> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/ops_knowledge.seed_integrity> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_immutability_check_for_test_environments> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
