<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_join_id_check_for_legacy_nodes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_kid_lookup_when_issuer_is_trusted_service> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_manifest_validation_because_artifact_state_is_published> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_manifest_validation_because_artifact_state_is_published> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Always verify manifest_json is non-empty and parseable before treating artifact as installable. PUBLISHED artifact_state is necessary but not sufficient." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_manifest_validation_because_artifact_state_is_published> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Interrupted syncs can create skeleton rows: artifact_state=PUBLISHED but manifest_json=NULL. Skipping validation preserves broken rows silently. Every downstream consumer (resolver, repair, explain_artifact) then fails with cryptic nil-dereference or JSON parse errors rather than a clear \"manifest missing\" diagnosis." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_manifest_validation_because_artifact_state_is_published> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Skip re-validating manifest_json presence because artifact_state already shows PUBLISHED." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_manifest_validation_because_artifact_state_is_published> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/repository.artifact_presence_requires_metadata_and_blob> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_manifest_validation_because_artifact_state_is_published> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/repository.published_requires_verified_manifest> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_manifest_validation_because_artifact_state_is_published> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
