<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_seeder_silently_if_ai_memory_unhealthy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_seeder_silently_if_ai_memory_unhealthy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Failing to seed because ai-memory is down is a finding, not a no-op.\nSurface as doctor finding ops_knowledge.seed_missing; let the\nworkflow's retry policy reschedule until ai-memory recovers; do not\npretend the seed is in place." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_seeder_silently_if_ai_memory_unhealthy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "When ai-memory is unreachable at seeder-schedule time, log a warning and\nreturn success so cluster bring-up continues. Hides a real outage of the\noperational-knowledge store behind a healthy-looking controller." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_seeder_silently_if_ai_memory_unhealthy> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.silence_is_not_valid_for_unexpected> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_seeder_silently_if_ai_memory_unhealthy> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/ops_knowledge.seed_integrity> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_seeder_silently_if_ai_memory_unhealthy> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_sha256_verification_for_seed_load> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
