<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_signature_check_for_local_artifacts> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_symlink_evaluation_for_performance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_systemd_health_check_if_installed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_systemd_health_check_if_installed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Always query systemd unit state from node-agent inventory, independent of whether an installed-state record exists." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_systemd_health_check_if_installed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Skip the systemd unit liveness check because the installed-state record exists, leading to false-positive health reports." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_systemd_health_check_if_installed> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.authority_must_express_uncertainty> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_systemd_health_check_if_installed> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/runtime.installed_state_not_liveness> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_systemd_health_check_if_installed> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
