<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skip_wipe_when_minio_is_running> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_entrypoint_checksum_write_because_applypackagerelease_will_fix_it> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_service_packages_from_bom> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_service_packages_from_bom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Validate that every service in services.yaml is present in the BOM before publishing; use the awareness CI check to enforce BOM completeness." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_service_packages_from_bom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Omit one or more service packages from the release BOM, causing them to be absent from ServicesDesiredSet and therefore never installed on cluster nodes." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_service_packages_from_bom> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.silence_is_not_valid_for_unexpected> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_service_packages_from_bom> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/service.desired_state.bom_completeness> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_service_packages_from_bom> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_workflow_run_to_force_available> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_workflow_run_to_force_available> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Diagnose why the workflow commit failed; fix the underlying cause (Scylla timeout, leader change, network); retry the workflow run through the normal dispatch path." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_workflow_run_to_force_available> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Skip the workflow service entirely and write AVAILABLE directly to a ServiceRelease record in etcd to unstick a stuck release." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_workflow_run_to_force_available> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/convergence.no_infinite_retry> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_workflow_run_to_force_available> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/install.result.atomic_commit> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/skipping_workflow_run_to_force_available> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.state_mutations_must_be_durably_committed_before_side_effects> .
