<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/strip_local_version_suffix_to_promote_without_official_rebuild> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Run the official build pipeline: clean checkout, official build tools,\nnew version (1.2.53), new build_id, new digest, GitHub release asset,\nupdated release-index.json. The local build is evidence/reference only." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/strip_local_version_suffix_to_promote_without_official_rebuild> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A local build (version=1.2.43+local.ryzen.1) is validated and ready\nfor production. Shortcut: strip the suffix so it becomes 1.2.43 and\npublish as core@globular.io/stable. Avoids the official release pipeline.\nThis re-introduces the identity fraud the local lane was designed to prevent:\ntwo clusters now run different bytes under the same official identity." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/strip_local_version_suffix_to_promote_without_official_rebuild> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/package.official_identity_immutable> .
