<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/swallow_compacted_error_silently> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "On 'etcdserver: mvcc: required revision has been compacted' from the\nobjectstore-apply watcher, `continue` the loop and keep ranging over a\nchannel etcd will close on the next iteration. The goroutine exits;\nnothing re-spawns it." .
