<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treat_raw_string_fixture_annotations_as_source_annotations> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treat_raw_string_fixture_annotations_as_source_annotations> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Use Go AST to identify string literals; skip annotations inside ast.BasicLit nodes where the value starts with a backtick (raw string literals)." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treat_raw_string_fixture_annotations_as_source_annotations> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The annotation validator must not interpret //globular: directives inside raw string literals as source-level awareness contracts." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treat_raw_string_fixture_annotations_as_source_annotations> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/awareness.annotation_scanner.production_source_only> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treat_raw_string_fixture_annotations_as_source_annotations> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.assertions_must_carry_their_scope> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treat_raw_string_fixture_annotations_as_source_annotations> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treat_republish_as_update_rather_than_idempotent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treat_revocation_as_desired_state_mutation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treating_all_failures_as_transient> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#ForbiddenFix> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treating_all_failures_as_transient> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Classify failure root cause before retrying. Deterministic causes (config error, version mismatch, disk full) must not be retried. Only retry typed transient failures with a cap on retry count." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treating_all_failures_as_transient> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mark every failure as transient and schedule a retry regardless of whether the root cause can resolve itself without input change." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treating_all_failures_as_transient> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/convergence.no_infinite_retry> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treating_all_failures_as_transient> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.failure_response_must_contract_not_amplify> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#forbiddenFix/treating_all_failures_as_transient> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/forbidden_fixes.yaml" .
