<https://globular.io/awareness#guardrail/activation_empty_policy.high_risk_target> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#Guardrail> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#guardrail/activation_empty_policy.high_risk_target> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Edit is in a high-risk directory OR touches an authority surface (security/RBAC, repository publish/installability, workflow resume/receipts, cluster-doctor remediation, convergence, desired-state, runtime evidence) but the edit itself may be minor (rename, log message, non-behavioral)." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#guardrail/activation_empty_policy.high_risk_target> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Empty briefing policy: high_risk_target" .
