<https://globular.io/awareness#guardrail/activation_empty_policy.low_risk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Edit changes no behavior (formatting, typos, comments, test fixtures, import reorder, dependency bump with no API change)." .
