<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.heartbeat_stale_kind_manifest_old_pid_loop> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "deleting old artifact versions from the repository to stop heartbeat poisoning (destroys audit trail; correct fix is deduplication in heartbeat)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.heartbeat_stale_kind_manifest_old_pid_loop> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "suppressing service.old_pid_after_upgrade globally (loses the upgrade-bug signal)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.heartbeat_stale_kind_manifest_old_pid_loop> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Heartbeat processes old artifact versions with stale kind, permanently deleting correct installed-state records and producing old_pid_after_upgrade" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.heartbeat_stale_kind_manifest_old_pid_loop> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/infra.heartbeat_observer_only_not_authority> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.heartbeat_stale_kind_manifest_old_pid_loop> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/incident_patterns.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.heartbeat_stale_kind_manifest_old_pid_loop> <https://globular.io/awareness#exemplifies> <https://globular.io/awareness#failureMode/heartbeat.stale_kind_manifest_poisons_installed_state> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.heartbeat_stale_kind_manifest_old_pid_loop> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fnode_agent%2Fnode_agent_server%2Fheartbeat.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.heartbeat_stale_kind_manifest_old_pid_loop> <https://globular.io/awareness#severity> "critical" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#IncidentPattern> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "elevating `etcdctl del` of the two stale keys to \"supported recovery procedure\" — implies the sweep is acceptable to bypass" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "hardcoding which packages can ignore stale dep-blocks (special-casing always wears out)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "increasing the dep-block record's TTL so it expires naturally — replaces a known stall with a longer one" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "masking BLOCKED records in `hasUnservedNodes` so dispatch proceeds anyway — defeats the dep-block gate for legitimate inactive cases" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "one-shot clear inside `checkRuntimeDeps` at install time only — bootstrap window can re-write the record after install runs" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "removing the join-phase gate to \"make convergence faster\" — directly reintroduces INC-2026-0005" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Regression guard — the symmetric sweep that clears BLOCKED dep records must remain in place" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/convergence.no_infinite_retry> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/critical_state.absence_is_not_destructive_intent> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/reconcile.dep_block_records_must_be_cleared_when_dep_satisfies> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/incident_patterns.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <https://globular.io/awareness#exemplifies> <https://globular.io/awareness#failureMode/reconcile.stale_dep_block_persists_after_dep_active> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fcluster_controller%2Fcluster_controller_server%2Fcritical_key_prereqs.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fcluster_controller%2Fcluster_controller_server%2Freconcile_nodes.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <https://globular.io/awareness#protects> <https://globular.io/awareness#sourceFile/golang%2Fcluster_controller%2Fcluster_controller_server%2Frelease_pipeline.go> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.reconcile_stale_dep_block_never_cleared> <https://globular.io/awareness#severity> "critical" .
