<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.release_pipeline_setfields_wrong_switch_or_dispatch_discard> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "adding the SetFields case to all three apply functions \"to be safe\" — silent overwrite of one kind's status by another's patch path" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.release_pipeline_setfields_wrong_switch_or_dispatch_discard> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "increasing workflow queue capacity to hide the retry storm" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.release_pipeline_setfields_wrong_switch_or_dispatch_discard> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "raising the reconciler tick rate so drift-reconciler runs more often (mask, not fix)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.release_pipeline_setfields_wrong_switch_or_dispatch_discard> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "re-enqueueing via drift-reconciler timer instead of explicit RetryCount + NextRetryUnixMs" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.release_pipeline_setfields_wrong_switch_or_dispatch_discard> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "returning err from the dispatch site to \"make the failure loud\" — the engine-level err is nil for wave failures by contract" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.release_pipeline_setfields_wrong_switch_or_dispatch_discard> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SetFields case added to wrong apply function (or wave-blocked dispatch result discarded) leaves release stuck" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.release_pipeline_setfields_wrong_switch_or_dispatch_discard> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/convergence.no_infinite_retry> .
