<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.release_pipeline_setfields_wrong_switch_or_dispatch_discard> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/workflow.dispatch_is_not_completion> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.release_pipeline_setfields_wrong_switch_or_dispatch_discard> <https://globular.io/awareness#affects> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/workflow.success_requires_backend_confirmation> .
