<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.service_main_clobbers_ldflags_version> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "special-casing the affected service in detectGlobularBinaryVersion to fall back to the marker file" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.service_main_clobbers_ldflags_version> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "suppressing service.runtime_identity_unproven globally to silence the warning" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#incidentPattern/pat.service_main_clobbers_ldflags_version> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Service main() hardcodes Version=\"\" and wipes the build-time ldflags injection" .
