<https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.binding_outlives_evidence_until_invalidated> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Every binding carries 'I checked this then' — when 'now' is different from 'then', the binding is a phantom unless re-validated" .
