<https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.circular_dependency_must_have_break_glass> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Every circular dependency must have a break-glass path that doesn't go through the cycle — a system that deploys itself must have a path that doesn't go through itself" .
