<https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.code.composition_must_prefer_standard_protocols> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compose through standard protocols first — platform contracts (DOM, events, HTTP, gRPC, a11y) before private framework mechanisms" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.code.composition_must_prefer_standard_protocols> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/meta_principles.yaml" .
