<https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.code.contract_must_outlive_implementation_fashion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Contracts outlive implementation fashion — callers depend on semantic inputs/outputs/events, never private structure" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.code.contract_must_outlive_implementation_fashion> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/meta_principles.yaml" .
