<https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.code.debuggability_is_part_of_correctness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Debuggability is correctness — structure must preserve inspection, tracing, and a path from runtime behavior back to source intent" .
