<https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.code.extension_points_must_be_explicit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Variation happens at declared extension points — slots, properties, events, adapters — never by reaching into private internals" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.code.extension_points_must_be_explicit> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/meta_principles.yaml" .
