<https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/meta.code.identity_bound_state_must_not_be_copied> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A value whose meaning is bound to identity, hidden mutable state, or single ownership must not be copied, aliased, or shared without an explicit ownership/fencing rule" .
