<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.dell_join_ai_watcher_install_retry_never_dispatched> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#OutcomeFeedback> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.dell_join_ai_watcher_install_retry_never_dispatched> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "awareness_diagnose scoped the failure (one package of 25; everything else\nself-healed exactly as its forbidden_conclusions predicted) and node-agent\nlogs gave the root cause: envoy reload during the xds topology push for the\njoining node refused :443 for seconds; the failed install step's retry was\ndispatched for 24 packages but never for ai-watcher, whose unit (laid down\nbefore its binary) flapped to start-limit. The legal fix was the smallest\ntyped lever: `globular services desired set ai-watcher 1.2.208` — an\nidempotent re-assert that bumped the desired generation and let convergence\nre-plan; install + healthy unit followed in under a minute. No etcd\nsurgery, no unit hacks, no apply-desired (sidecar-skipping path).\nCandidate failure mode filed:\njoin.mesh_reload_must_not_terminalize_install_retries (candidates queue)." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.dell_join_ai_watcher_install_retry_never_dispatched> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dell join — ai-watcher install retry never dispatched after mesh reload; fixed via idempotent desired re-assert" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.dell_join_ai_watcher_install_retry_never_dispatched> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/outcomes/inc-dell-join-ai-watcher-stuck.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.dell_join_ai_watcher_install_retry_never_dispatched> <https://globular.io/awareness#decision> "applied" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.dell_join_ai_watcher_install_retry_never_dispatched> <https://globular.io/awareness#forFinding> "version:ai-watcher not installed (node 4c2b3cb3-d02a-56d3-93cf-4e2c8728e8a4)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.dell_join_ai_watcher_install_retry_never_dispatched> <https://globular.io/awareness#forTask> "fix version:ai-watcher FAIL not installed (desired 1.2.208) on joining node globule-dell" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.dell_join_ai_watcher_install_retry_never_dispatched> <https://globular.io/awareness#forWorkflowRun> "install_workloads step FAILED 25/25 at 20:43:03 (envoy mid-reload, :443 refused; release-index.json correctly absent on Day-1)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.dell_join_ai_watcher_install_retry_never_dispatched> <https://globular.io/awareness#observedAt> "2026-06-12" .
