<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#OutcomeFeedback> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "`_, err := workflow.Run(...)` discarded a RUN_STATUS_FAILED result with\nerr=nil, so a wave-blocked run was never retried (commit a03b1937). The fix\nmade the wave-blocked terminal result dispatch a bounded retry rather than\nsilently dropping it. Recorded as a success outcome linking the convergence\ninvariant and the durable-step-receipt recipe: the lesson is that a blocking\nresult is a completion obligation, and resume must act on it, not absorb it." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wave-blocked workflow retry dispatch fix converged" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/outcomes/inc-2026-0017-wave-blocked-retry.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <https://globular.io/awareness#decision> "applied" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <https://globular.io/awareness#forTask> "wave-blocked workflow result must dispatch a retry instead of discarding RUN_STATUS_FAILED" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <https://globular.io/awareness#forWorkflowRun> "InfrastructureRelease (wave-blocked)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <https://globular.io/awareness#observedAt> "2026-05" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeStatus> "success" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <https://globular.io/awareness#promotedFromIncident> "INC-2026-0017" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.inc_2026_0017_wave_blocked_retry> <https://globular.io/awareness#reasonCode> "wave_blocked_result_discarded" .
