<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#OutcomeFeedback> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An auto-remediation plan proposed an ETCD_DELETE to clear a key the doctor\nread as stale. The remediation gate correctly refused to auto-execute:\nETCD_PUT, ETCD_DELETE, and NODE_REMOVE are hard-blocked and require explicit\nhuman approval. Recorded as a BLOCKED outcome so the graph can answer \"which\ninvariants/patterns were involved in blocked runs\" — here the hard-block\ninvariant and the remediation-via-workflow recipe. This is a desired block,\nnot a defect: missing-or-stale evidence must never drive a destructive action." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Auto-remediation correctly blocked on ETCD_DELETE action" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/outcomes/remediation-hard-blocked-etcd-delete.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <https://globular.io/awareness#decision> "rejected" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <https://globular.io/awareness#failureClass> "hard_blocked_action" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <https://globular.io/awareness#forFinding> "critical_state.stale_key/<node>/<key>" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <https://globular.io/awareness#forTask> "auto-remediate a cluster finding by deleting a stale etcd key" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <https://globular.io/awareness#observedAt> "2026-06" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeStatus> "blocked" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <https://globular.io/awareness#reasonCode> "etcd_delete_requires_human_approval" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#outcomeFeedback/outcome.remediation_hard_blocked_etcd_delete> <https://globular.io/awareness#status> "active" .
