<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.cluster_desired_state> <https://globular.io/awareness#observedViaPath> "controller RPC or read-only etcd read of controller-owned keys" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.cluster_desired_state> <https://globular.io/awareness#status> "active" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#RuntimeEvidence> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A finding must carry source service, observed time, and trust/freshness.\nMissing evidence yields UNKNOWN / CHECK_ERROR, never PASS." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Cluster-doctor finding evidence" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/runtime_evidence.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#cannotPromoteToPassWhenStale> "true" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#conflictsWithEvidence> "a partial snapshot consumed as if complete" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#evidenceForAuthorityDomain> <https://globular.io/awareness#authorityDomain/authority.remediation_execution> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#evidenceForInvariant> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/evidence.missing_is_not_known_bad> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#evidenceForRepairPlan> <https://globular.io/awareness#repairPlan/globular.repair.doctor_finding_requires_remediation> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#hasFreshnessWindow> "must be from the current sweep; consult snap.Errors before concluding" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#hasTrustLevel> "medium" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#mustComeFromOwnerPath> "true" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#observedFromService> "cluster-doctor (collector snapshot)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#observedViaPath> "doctor collector snapshot (with snap.Errors completeness markers)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.doctor_finding> <https://globular.io/awareness#status> "active" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#RuntimeEvidence> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Permission truth comes from the RBAC evaluation path. A header, proxy, or\nuser-claim shortcut is not permission truth." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RBAC authorization evidence" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/runtime_evidence.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#cannotPromoteToPassWhenStale> "true" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#conflictsWithEvidence> "a header / proxy / user claim used as permission truth" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#evidenceForAuthorityDomain> <https://globular.io/awareness#authorityDomain/authority.rbac_permissions> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#evidenceForInvariant> <https://globular.io/awareness#invariant/backend_must_check_originating_principal_not_only_peer_cert> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#evidenceForRepairPlan> <https://globular.io/awareness#repairPlan/globular.repair.rbac_permission_regression> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#hasFreshnessWindow> "evaluated per request against current permissions" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#hasTrustLevel> "high" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#mustComeFromOwnerPath> "true" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#observedFromService> "rbac (rbac.RbacService permission evaluation)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#observedViaPath> "RBAC ValidateAccess / ValidateAction through the interceptor chain" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.rbac_authorization> <https://globular.io/awareness#status> "active" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#RuntimeEvidence> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Installability is proven by lifecycle metadata from the repository owner,\nnot by a bucket listing. Stale metadata cannot prove installability." .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Repository lifecycle metadata evidence" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#authoredIn> "docs/awareness/runtime_evidence.yaml" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#cannotPromoteToPassWhenStale> "true" .
