<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#evidenceForRepairPlan> <https://globular.io/awareness#repairPlan/globular.repair.repository_artifact_lifecycle_stuck> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#hasFreshnessWindow> "must reflect the latest committed publish_state transition" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#hasTrustLevel> "high" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#mustComeFromOwnerPath> "true" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#observedFromService> "repository (repository.PackageRepository)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#observedViaPath> "repository resolver RPC (publish_state / artifact_state)" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.repository_metadata> <https://globular.io/awareness#status> "active" .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.workflow_receipt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://globular.io/awareness#RuntimeEvidence> .
<https://globular.io/awareness#runtimeEvidence/evidence.workflow_receipt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The receipt is evidence of a completed/classified step. Resume must check\nthe receipt before repeating any side effect." .
